late:"Create a premium, modern, conversion-focused landing page for [Brand/Product Name] targeting [Target Audience], with the goal of [Primary Goal]. Design it with the polish of leading tech brands—clean typography, generous whitespace, refined gradients, subtle glassmorphism, premium visuals, and smooth, elegant animations including scroll reveals, staggered entrances, hover effects, ambient motion, and interactive microinteractions. Include a complete landing page structure (sticky navbar, hero, social proof, features, product showcase, benefits, testimonials, pricing, FAQ, CTA, and footer), ensuring it is fully responsive, accessible, mobile-first, visually stunning, and production-ready with compelling copy tailored to the brand."},{id:"build-dashboard",headline:"dashboard.headline",description:"dashboard.description",icon:q.StatsReport,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.WEBDEV},template:"Create an interactive analytics dashboard for [Domain — e.g. SaaS metrics, fitness tracking, personal finance] aimed at [Users]. Include KPI summary cards with trend indicators, a mix of line, bar, and donut charts with hover tooltips and smooth transitions, a sortable and filterable data table, and date-range and segment filters that update every view live. Use a clean, modern visual style with clear layout hierarchy and a dark mode toggle, generate realistic sample data so every chart feels alive, and make it fully responsive."},{id:"make-a-game",headline:"game.headline",description:"game.description",icon:q.Arcade,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.WEBDEV},template:"Build a polished, playable browser game: [Game Idea — e.g. a fast-paced snake remix, a physics puzzler, a typing racer]. Make the core loop fun within the first ten seconds, with tight controls for both keyboard and touch, and juicy feedback — screen shake, particle effects, and satisfying animations. Include a start screen, a score system, pause and game-over states with instant restart, and a local high-score table. Style it with a cohesive visual theme and make sure it runs smoothly at 60fps on desktop and mobile."},{id:"design-to-code",headline:"designToCode.headline",description:"designToCode.description",icon:q.FrameSelect,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.WEBDEV,opensFilePicker:!0},template:"Recreate the attached design as a pixel-perfect, production-ready web page. Match the layout, spacing, typography, colors, and imagery exactly, and implement it with clean, semantic markup and modern CSS. Make it fully responsive across mobile, tablet, and desktop, add tasteful hover states and scroll animations that fit the design's style, and where any detail is ambiguous, make polished, on-brand decisions that elevate the original."},{id:"build-fullstack-app",headline:"fullstackApp.headline",description:"fullstackApp.description",icon:q.Database,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.WEBDEV},template:"Build a full-stack [App Type — e.g. task manager, booking tool, team dashboard] for [Target Users] with [Key Features]. Include authentication, a clean dashboard layout with sidebar navigation, full CRUD flows for the core resources, and persistent data storage. Use a modern, polished UI with empty states, loading states, optimistic updates, and responsive design, and seed it with realistic demo data so the app feels alive on first load."},{id:"launch-storefront",headline:"storefront.headline",description:"storefront.description",icon:q.ShopFourTiles,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.WEBDEV},template:"Build a beautiful e-commerce storefront for [Store Name] selling [Product Type] to [Target Customers]. Include a striking home page with featured collections, a product grid with filters and sorting, rich product detail pages with image galleries and reviews, a slide-out cart, and a streamlined checkout flow. Use elegant typography, premium product imagery, tasteful animations, and persistent cart state, and seed it with realistic demo products, prices, and reviews so the shop feels open for business — all fully responsive and production-ready."}],e9=[e6,...e7],e8={code:[...e7.filter(e=>"design-to-code"!==e.id),{id:"build-3d-scene",headline:"threeDScene.headline",description:"threeDScene.description",icon:q.Layers,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.WEBDEV},template:"Build an interactive 3D scene in the browser with Three.js: [Scene — e.g. a low-poly floating island with a waterfall, a solar system you can orbit, a neon city at night]. Add orbit controls, soft dynamic lighting with shadows, and gentle ambient animation, plus [Interaction — e.g. clicking a planet shows its facts, hovering lights up the buildings] so the scene rewards exploration. Keep it smooth at 60fps, add a small on-screen hint for the controls, and make it work on desktop and mobile."}],image:[{id:"design-logo",headline:"designLogo.headline",description:"designLogo.description",icon:q.Target,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.IMAGE},template:"Design a modern, minimal logo for [Brand Name], a [Business Type — e.g. specialty coffee roaster, fintech startup, yoga studio] that feels [Personality — e.g. bold, playful, premium]. Pair a simple, memorable symbol with clean typography in a limited color palette that fits the brand, in a flat vector style on a plain white background. Keep it balanced, scalable, and legible at small sizes, with no mockups, extra text, or watermarks."},{id:"product-photo",headline:"productPhoto.headline",description:"productPhoto.description",icon:q.Package,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.IMAGE},template:"A professional studio photo of [Product — e.g. a ceramic pour-over coffee set, a leather weekender bag] on [Backdrop — e.g. a marble countertop, a seamless pastel sweep]. Soft, diffused key light with gentle shadows and subtle reflections, a shallow depth of field, crisp focus on the materials and textures, a few minimal styling props, and a clean, premium e-commerce look. Photorealistic, high resolution, centered composition."},{id:"event-poster",headline:"eventPoster.headline",description:"eventPoster.description",icon:q.Calendar,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.IMAGE},template:'An eye-catching poster for an event called "[Event Name — e.g. Blue Hour]". Below the title, add the line "[Date and Venue — e.g. Friday, June 6 at The Loft]". Use a bold layout with one striking focal illustration, expressive typography where the event name is the hero, and a cohesive [Style — e.g. retro screen print, Swiss modernist, neon synthwave] look. Spell both lines exactly as written, add no other text, keep the text legible from across a room, and leave balanced negative space.'},{id:"illustrate-scene",headline:"illustrateScene.headline",description:"illustrateScene.description",icon:q.Image,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.IMAGE},template:"A richly detailed illustration of [Scene — e.g. a fox reading by lantern light in a snowy forest, a floating market on a canal city at dawn] in the style of [Art Style — e.g. soft anime watercolor, vintage storybook gouache, bold comic ink]. Warm, cinematic lighting, a clear focal point, layered depth from foreground to background, a harmonious color palette, and small charming details that reward a closer look."},{id:"character-sheet",headline:"characterSheet.headline",description:"characterSheet.description",icon:q.User,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.IMAGE},template:"A character design sheet for [Character — e.g. a cheerful robot chef, a weathered elven ranger] with [Signature Details — e.g. a patched apron and one glowing eye, a moss-green cloak]. Show front, side, and back views plus three facial expressions, in a clean [Art Style — e.g. stylized 3D, anime, flat vector] style on a neutral background, with consistent proportions, colors, and costume details across every view."},{id:"design-room",headline:"designRoom.headline",description:"designRoom.description",icon:q.Lightbulb,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.IMAGE},template:"A photorealistic interior render of a [Room — e.g. small Scandinavian living room, cozy attic reading nook] in a [Style — e.g. Japandi, mid-century modern, warm industrial] style, featuring [Key Pieces — e.g. a velvet sofa, open oak shelving, a statement pendant lamp]. Natural light from large windows, realistic materials and textures, tasteful decor, and the composition of a high-end architecture magazine photo."}],video:[{id:"slow-motion",headline:"slowMotion.headline",description:"slowMotion.description",icon:q.Clock,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.VIDEO},template:"An ultra slow-motion shot of [Moment — e.g. a water balloon bursting, a drop of milk splashing into coffee, a hummingbird hovering] against a [Backdrop — e.g. dark studio background, sunlit garden]. Crisp detail on every ripple and particle, physically accurate motion, dramatic rim lighting, and a smooth, steady camera."},{id:"product-ad",headline:"productAd.headline",description:"productAd.description",icon:q.Package,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.VIDEO},template:"A polished short commercial for [Product — e.g. a smart water bottle, a pair of trail running shoes]. Open on a striking hero shot with a slow orbit, then cut to the product in use in [Setting — e.g. a sunlit kitchen, a rainy city street] with a smooth push-in. Bright, premium lighting, a [Mood — e.g. energetic, calm, luxurious] tone, crisp material detail, and a clean final frame that holds on the product."},{id:"cinematic-shot",headline:"cinematicShot.headline",description:"cinematicShot.description",icon:q.Film,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.VIDEO},template:"A cinematic shot of [Scene — e.g. a lone astronaut crossing a red desert at dusk, a detective under a flickering streetlight], filmed as a [Camera Move — e.g. slow dolly-in, sweeping drone pass, handheld tracking shot]. Anamorphic lens look, dramatic [Lighting — e.g. golden hour, neon-lit rain, moody overcast] lighting, rich color grading, shallow depth of field, and realistic motion and physics throughout."},{id:"wildlife-film",headline:"wildlifeFilm.headline",description:"wildlifeFilm.description",icon:q.Eye,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.VIDEO},template:"A breathtaking nature documentary shot of [Subject — e.g. a snow leopard stalking along a rocky ridge, a hummingbird hovering at a flower] in [Location — e.g. the Himalayas, a tropical rainforest]. Ultra-realistic fur, feathers, and textures, natural light, a steady telephoto lens with subtle tracking, a slow-motion beat on the key moment, and the calm, awe-inspiring feel of a high-end wildlife film."},{id:"animated-short",headline:"animatedShort.headline",description:"animatedShort.description",icon:q.Play,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.VIDEO},template:"A charming animated short in a [Animation Style — e.g. 3D feature-film, hand-drawn 2D, claymation] style: [Story — e.g. a tiny robot tries to water a flower that keeps growing taller]. Expressive character animation, a clear setup and payoff, bright and appealing colors, and smooth camera framing that follows the action."},{id:"travel-montage",headline:"travelMontage.headline",description:"travelMontage.description",icon:q.Globe,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.VIDEO},template:"A dreamy travel montage of [Destination — e.g. Kyoto in autumn, the Amalfi Coast, Iceland's highlands]: [Two Key Moments — e.g. a misty temple at sunrise and a bustling night market]. Smooth gimbal and drone shots, golden-hour light, one smooth transition between the two scenes, warm film-like color grading, and an inviting, wanderlust feel."}],search:[{id:"news-briefing",headline:"newsBriefing.headline",description:"newsBriefing.description",icon:q.Newspaper,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.SEARCH},template:"What are the most important developments in [Topic — e.g. AI regulation, the electric vehicle market, the Champions League] from the past week? Give me a concise briefing with the key events, why each one matters, and what to watch next, and cite a reliable source for every claim."},{id:"compare-products",headline:"compareProducts.headline",description:"compareProducts.description",icon:q.ShopFourTiles,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.SEARCH},template:"I'm shopping for [Product — e.g. noise-cancelling headphones, a robot vacuum] with a budget of [Budget], and I care most about [Priorities — e.g. battery life, comfort, easy setup]. Compare the best current options in a table with prices, key specs, pros, and cons, then recommend the best pick for me and explain why, citing recent reviews."},{id:"plan-trip",headline:"planTrip.headline",description:"planTrip.description",icon:q.Globe,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.SEARCH},template:"Plan a [Trip Length — e.g. 4-day, week-long] trip to [Destination and Dates — e.g. Lisbon in early May] for [Travelers — e.g. a couple who love food, a family with young kids]. Build a day-by-day itinerary with top sights, neighborhoods to explore, and restaurants worth booking, and include current opening hours, ticket prices, local events, and the weather to expect, with links to sources."},{id:"research-company",headline:"researchCompany.headline",description:"researchCompany.description",icon:q.Building,action:{type:"modality",modality:i.EEvaluationModality.SEARCH},template:"Give me an up-to-date overview of [Company]: what it does, how it makes money, its latest funding or financial results, its leadership, its main competitors, and its biggest news from the last six months. Finish with the key risks and opportunities, and cite your sources."},{id:"fact-check",headline:"factCheck.headline",description